 "remarks": "Ideally located in the heart of downtown Greenwich, this beautifully renovated single-family home offers the perfect combination of convenience, comfort, and style. Just minutes from Greenwich Avenue, Metro-North, Greenwich Library, and all that downtown has to offer, the home has been thoughtfully renovated from top to bottom with high-quality finishes and attention to detail throughout. A charming loft off the second bedroom provides flexible space for a home office, play space or additional living area. Enjoy outdoor living on the spacious covered rear patio, plus the convenience of off-street parking for two cars. Offered furnished and move-in ready--just bring your toothbrush and settle right in!",
